        "source_note": "Published BM3-MGD coefficients accepted unchanged on parameter agreement, following the 2026-10-19 maintainer decision. The confirmed selected author input has 21 literature cold and 146 thermal rows, excluding all 11 unsuitable quenched rows. Weighted and equal-weight cold-then-thermal EosFit fits recover all three cold coefficients within published error widths; equal-weight gamma0 is inside the published width and the weighted gamma0 interval overlaps it. Actual distributed-GUI fits agree closely with the console. Reconstruction remains classified similar: source error confidence and cross-fit covariance are unspecified and thermal errors condition on fixed cold coefficients. The staged weighted GUI thermal replay has RMS 1.63 GPa, maximum 5.29 GPa, and 12/146 rows outside +/-3 GPa. This residual-reporting discrepancy does not block use; exact original author-workflow reproduction is not claimed. See docs/literature-reproductions/fes-gui-replay.md and docs/literature-reproductions/fes-eosfit-direct.md.",
