      "notes": "One published volume relation fitted jointly across FeS-VI, FeS-IV and FeS-IX. V0 is an extrapolated EOS parameter, distinct from the structural cell measured at 56 GPa and 300 K. Use within the paper's 40-150 GPa model range and the observed thermal coverage.",
